version 0.11
symbol nmos-5

description N-channel MOSFET, 5-pin generic view
tags mosfet n-channel power
pin_numbers hide
pin_names hide
# N-channel MOSFET as the discrete-transistor glyph: enclosing circle, gate plate on the left, the channel as three
# segments, and the bulk arrow pointing at the channel (the direction that says N-channel). The drain leaves straight
# up, the gate straight left, and the three source pins share one bus below the circle.
# Pin 4 is the gate. Pin 5 is the drain; pins 1/2/3 all land on the source bus.
# Pin connection points, pin tails, and the body frame sit on the 0.5 mm placement lattice (ADR-0057).
field Reference at=[0,6.5] U
field Value at=[0,-7.5] nmos-5

